 🏗️ Kennedy Center could be "ripped down" : President Trump told reporters while campaigning in Charlotte that his name should be on the Kennedy Center in exchange for fixing and subsidizing it, "because frankly, if we don't do that, it's going to close. It'll end up being ripped down — it's in very, very bad shape, very dangerous shape."

 
 
