 4. 💰 CEO confidence hits 4-year high 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 New this morning: CEO economic confidence is the highest since 2022, with that optimism now spilling into plans to hire more workers, Axios Macro authors Courtenay Brown and Neil Irwin write. 

 The Business Roundtable's CEO Economic Outlook Index climbed 3 points in the third quarter, to 94 — the fifth consecutive increase and well above the historical average of 83. The index has climbed steadily from a five-year low after President Trump's "liberation day" tariffs early last year. Explore the data ... Keep reading . 

 
 
